包含向量 v_1 到 v_n，并假设这是一个线性无关集，那么 S 可以扩充为 V 的一组基 v_1, ..., v_n, v_{n+1}, ..., v_m。
sorry, S, and it'll contain vectors v_1 through v_n, and assume that this is a linearly independent set, then S can be extended to a basis v_1, ..., v_n, v_{n+1} up to v_m of V.

3
00:01:25,388 --> 00:01:39,627
这起初看起来像是某种简单、显而易见的结果，且某种意义上证明并不难，但尽管如此，这依然是一个极其重要的结论，
Now this looks at first like some sort of simple obvious result, and the proof wasn't very hard in some sense, but nonetheless this is a very, very important result insofar as it completely informs

4
00:01:39,627 --> 00:01:53,562
因为它彻底指引了我们思考处理向量空间的方式，并且对我们分析向量空间的群论性质的能力产生深远影响。
the way we think about manipulating vector spaces, and it's going to have a major impact on our ability to analyze the sort of group- theoretic properties of vector spaces.

5
00:01:53,562 --> 00:02:06,000
因此为了强化这个观点，我将考察该结论的一些推论，其中一部分我们上次已经以某种形式见过，另一些则是全新的。
So just to reinforce that idea, I'm going to look at some consequences of this particular result, some of which we saw last time in some form, others which are somewhat new.

6
